      "html": "<p>A real strange fish was imported from the south of Brazil. It belongs to the genus Glanidium and reaches a size of about 40 cm, which is really big for such a fish.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/10-catfishes/10c-catfishes-remaining-catfish-from-south-america/_en-16/",
      "html": "<p>They look very calm, but during the night they start to eat everything they can get into their big mouth, so be careful with other inhabitants you want to keep together with them.</p>"
    },
    {
